  "scope": [
    "Four serial ABBA fresh full source-to-Object observations with the same 54 existing runtime flags and host statistics. Bootstrap, screen, tests, fixtures, diagnostic and archiving are excluded. No competing work overlaps primary timing.",
    "Every query retains the same selected graph, action/terminator reads, predicate context, tail stops and original ordered definition lookups/validation, including unread values. No semantic proof or liveness result is cached.",
    "Only materialized kill facts are filtered to values read in the selected graph and sites belonging to that graph. Unread values cannot seed liveness; outside sites cannot kill a selected fact. Out-of-range read IDs retain their prior solver behavior.",
    "The separate diagnostic observes 790 distinct exact contexts, median 284 selected sites, median 23850 definition facts and median nine live values. Its graph/solver timers are nested in preparation and are not primary timing observations.",
    "All source, MBC, Object and complete metadata bytes match the previously qualified fast control in every primary observation and separate screen. All four outputs also match between subjects in six array/enum and eight checked scalar programs.",
    "All 11 liveness tests pass, including dense/sparse/reference agreement after removing irrelevant definitions on 256 cyclic/branching graphs and nine starts per graph, unused high IDs and outside definition sites.",
    "Candidate peak RSS is higher with nonoverlapping matched ranges; no memory saving is claimed. All adverse counters and unchanged-stage elapsed variation remain, without causal attribution to this filter. Four compiles are descriptive, not a population estimate.",
    "No new runtime latency campaign is claimed; main/helper machine code and metadata remain byte-identical. The copied complete state fixture assembly provenance includes earlier attempts, not a new fragment-only launch.",
    "Diagnostic instrumentation is restored before the functional edit. Its complete source, patch, build, query logs, restored-source hashes and outputs remain. Diagnostic addresses are observations, never semantic cache keys.",
    "Grammar, language, current-visit/ownership checks, error order, finite admission and backend optimization level are unchanged. Full compilation remains above ten seconds."
